<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NHTML v0.7.1 | Showcase Hub</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/examples/assets/premium.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="premium-container">
        <h1><img src="/assets/logo.png" style="height: 40px; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 15px;"> NHTML Showcase</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Expérimentez la puissance du protocole NBPS v0.7.1 à travers ces démos interactives.</p>

        <div class="grid">
            <a href="/examples/counter/index.nhtml" class="card">
                <span class="badge">Stable</span>
                <span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-calculator"></i></span>
                <h3>Counter Demo</h3>
                <p>Incrémentation temps-réel via WebSocket. La base de la réactivité NHTML.</p>
            </a>

            <a href="/examples/02-todo-list/index.nhtml" class="card">
                <span class="badge">New</span>
                <span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-check-double"></i></span>
                <h3>Todo List</h3>
                <p>Gestion de liste dynamique avec persistance SQLite et patchs DOM optimisés.</p>
            </a>

            <a href="/examples/03-live-form/index.nhtml" class="card">
                <span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-file-lines"></i></span>
                <h3>Live Form</h3>
                <p>Validation côté serveur en temps réel sans rechargement de page.</p>
            </a>

            <a href="/examples/04-style-lab/index.nhtml" class="card">
                <span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-palette"></i></span>
                <h3>Style Lab</h3>
                <p>Modification dynamique des propriétés CSS et des classes via le protocole binaire.</p>
            </a>

            <a href="/examples/05-chat/index.nhtml" class="card highlight">
                <span class="badge premium">Premium</span>
                <span class="icon"><i class="fas fa-comments"></i></span>
                <h3>Live Chat</h3>
                <p>Expérience de messagerie instantanée fluide avec design premium glassmorphism.</p>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
